export anchor DarkGlassStyle:
    number: 247
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark glass
    idea: The canvas sits on a deep, softly glowing colour field and every tool floats above it as translucent dark glass, so the work feels lit from behind while text stays on dark tint.
    base: dark
    palette:
        base: #0a0b16, the page under the glow
        violetGlow: #7b3fe4, a large radial blob at 75 percent top left
        tealGlow: #1fa5c9, a radial blob at 70 percent top right
        roseGlow: #e0457b, a radial blob at 60 percent at the bottom, also the spacing guide
        glass: #101220, panels at 72 percent with a 28px blur and 150 percent saturation
        edge: #ffffff, panel rims at 16 percent and a 22 percent inner top highlight
        ink: #f3f4fb, text
        muted: #bcc0d4, labels and idle icons
        cyan: #7fe3ff, Share, the active tool, the selected row ring, frame selection and focus
        cyanInk: #04222c, text and icons on cyan
        saved: #86f0b5, the Saved chip
        pin: #ffd27a, the comment pin
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 13px at 1.45. File name 13px 700, panel titles 12px 600
        muted, values with tabular numbers and the sheet title 28px 700.
    layout:
        The whole editor sits on a 780px colour field made of four radial
        glows. Three glass pills float across the top, the file pill with a
        round gradient B, the tool pill centred with six 40px round tools,
        Move filled cyan, and 66%, and the people pill with overlapping
        ringed initials, Present and a cyan Share. A 248px glass layers
        panel floats left and a 264px glass inspector floats right, both
        hugging their content. The Hero frame floats in the middle with a
        cyan ring, round handles and a deep shadow, and the comment bubble
        is itself glass. The inspector holds tinted blocks for Position and
        size, Fill, Auto layout with pill segments, Corner radius and
        Export. A glass status pill is centred at the bottom. Below 1120px
        the tool pill drops to its own row. Below 760px the side panels
        hide and the tool pill floats under the canvas above the status.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px gaps between floating panels, 14px panel padding, 10 to 12px inside blocks.
    density: Medium. Three floating pills, two side panels and one status pill.
    corners: Large. 20px panels, 14px blocks, 10px fields, pill tools, buttons and segments.
    borders: 1px white at 16 percent around glass and 8 to 10 percent around inner blocks.
    shadows: An inset 1px top highlight plus 0 12px 40px black at 35 percent, and 0 30px 80px under the frame.
    icons:
        18px rounded line icons at 1.6px stroke in 40px round tools. Saved
        uses a check circle on a faint green chip, editing two people and the
        version a tag, each with its words.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 2px with a 6px cyan halo at 25 percent.
    tone: Light and calm, such as Position and size and Export.
